== Effects ==
* Spawns 2 - 4 {{e|Locked Chest}}s.

== Notes ==
* The spawned Locked Chests have a 0.833% chance to be replaced by {{e|Mega Chest}}s if they are unlocked.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: Spawns 4-14 {{E|Locked Chest}}s.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth}} + {{i|Blank Card}}: Only 2-7 chests spawn.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|The Left Hand}}: Turns all spawned chests into {{e|Red Chest}}s.

== Unlocking Bugs ==
* If option of Item Description is turned on, game might crash.
** To fix this issue, player can disable Item Description for the duration of the Challenge #43 Cantripped!

